OL,3,GNEWSA'Staff spat at and wrestled'
OL,4,Aduring shop abuse
OL,5,
OL,6,FLaurissa Woolgar, a retail manager,
OL,7,Fsays she has been spat at and has
OL,8,Fwitnessed colleagues being physically
OL,9,Fattacked by shoplifters.
OL,11,F"We've been sworn at, there's a lot of
OL,12,Fverbal abuse," she says. "My colleagues
OL,13,Fhave been wrestled with as they've
OL,14,Ftried to get items off them."
OL,16,FThe Retail Trust charity is now rolling
OL,17,Fout a safety training programme after a
OL,18,Fsurvey by the Union of Shop,
OL,19,FDistributive and Allied Workers (Usdaw)
OL,20,Ffound 11% of staff said they had been
OL,21,Fassaulted at work last year.
OL,23,APub: 19-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
