OL,3,GNEWSA'Staff spat at and wrestled'
OL,4,Aduring shop abuse
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe government says no one should go to
OL,7,Fwork fearing for their safety and it is
OL,8,Fmaking it a specific criminal offence
OL,9,Fto assault a retail worker.
